WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
At the shop, one wrong tap can feel like a big risk.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Nook sets the scene. This is practice; no money moves.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Choose what works for you: practise, watch, or read the steps.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
On the pretend phone, Nook highlights the next tap and offers a hint.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Find the QR button, then follow one small step at a time.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Before paying, check that the name on screen matches the shop board.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:44.000
A pretend caller asks for a PIN. You never need one to receive money.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Three reminders, then the real app when ready.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Nook.
